sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant UI as MainWindow (主线程)
    participant T as QThread (工作线程)
    participant W as BookQueryWorker
    participant DB as SQLite 数据库
    participant M as CoverCardModel
    participant V as QListView / CoverCardDelegate

    UI->>UI: __init__() 初始化
    UI->>T: new QThread()
    UI->>W: new BookQueryWorker(db_name)
    UI->>W: moveToThread(T)
    UI->>W: connect books_ready -> _on_books_loaded
    UI->>W: connect query_error -> _on_query_error
    UI->>W: connect trigger_fetch -> fetch_all_books
    UI->>T: start()

    UI->>UI: refresh_view()
    alt 缓存有效
        UI->>UI: _on_books_loaded(cache)
        UI->>M: set_books(cache)
        UI->>V: View 自动刷新
    else 缓存过期
        UI->>W: trigger_fetch.emit()
        W-->>T: QueuedConnection 排队到工作线程
        T->>W: fetch_all_books()
        W->>DB: SELECT * FROM books_information
        DB-->>W: 返回 books 列表
        W->>W: 组装 result
        W-->>UI: books_ready.emit(result)
        UI->>UI: _on_books_loaded(books)
        UI->>M: set_books(books)
        UI->>V: 刷新封面卡片
    end

    Note over UI,V: 主线程只更新 Model/View，数据库查询不阻塞 UI

    UI->>T: closeEvent() -> quit()
    T-->>UI: 线程退出
    UI->>DB: db.close()